            <div class="mb-1.5"><span class="rounded bg-cyan-500/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">Connection Pool</span></div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-(--fg-dim)">Opening a DB connection costs ~10–50 ms (TCP + auth + SSL). A pool keeps N connections open and <em>reuses</em> them — workers borrow a slot, run the query, return it.</p>
            <div class="sql-pool-diagram mt-3">
              <div class="sql-pool-row">
                {Array.from({length:5}).map((_, i) => (
                  <div class:list={["sql-pool-slot-static", i < 3 ? "sql-pool-used" : "sql-pool-free"]}>
                    {i < 3 ? "W" + (i+1) : "—"}
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <p class="text-[10px] text-(--fg-faint) mt-1">Pool 5 · 3 active · 2 free</p>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] text-(--fg-faint) border-l-2 border-rose-500/40 pl-2">All slots taken → requests queue → timeout. That is pool exhaustion.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="sql-explain-box" style="border-color:rgb(251 191 36/0.35)">
            <div class="mb-1.5"><span class="rounded bg-amber-500/15 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">Token Bucket</span></div>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-(--fg-dim)">Bucket holds up to <em>capacity</em> tokens, refills at <em>fill rate</em>/s. Each request consumes 1 token. Empty bucket → request dropped.</p>
            <div class="sql-bucket-diagram mt-3">
              <div class="sql-bucket-visual">
                <div class="sql-bucket-fill" style="height:60%"><span>12</span></div>
                <div class="sql-bucket-cap-label">20</div>
              </div>
              <div class="sql-bucket-info text-[10px] text-(--fg-dim)">
                <div>Capacity: 20 tokens</div>
                <div class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">Fill: +5 tok/s</div>
                <div class="text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">Requests: 8 req/s</div>
                <div class="text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">→ 3 req/s dropped</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[10px] text-(--fg-faint) border-l-2 border-amber-500/40 pl-2">Burst up to capacity is absorbed. Sustained above fill rate always drops.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Config reference -->
    <details class="group rounded-xl border border-(--border) bg-(--bg-alt)">
      <summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between gap-3 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-(--fg-dim) hover:text-(--fg) [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
