          <div class="rounded-lg border border-cyan-500/30 bg-(--bg) p-3 space-y-2">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-cyan-400">Physical (Streaming) Replication</p>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[11px] list-none">
              <li>✓ Streams raw WAL bytes — exact block-level copy</li>
              <li>✓ Standby is byte-for-byte identical to primary</li>
              <li>✓ Used for HA failover (pg_basebackup + streaming)</li>
              <li>✗ Same PG major version required</li>
              <li>✗ Cannot replicate a subset of tables</li>
            </ul>
            <pre class="sql-details-pre thin-scrollbar mt-2 text-[10px]">{`-- primary pg_hba.conf
host replication replicator standby_ip/32 md5

-- standby postgresql.conf
primary_conninfo = 'host=primary ...'
hot_standby = on`}</pre>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-violet-500/30 bg-(--bg) p-3 space-y-2">
            <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-violet-400">Logical Replication</p>
            <ul class="space-y-1 text-[11px] list-none">
              <li>✓ Row-level changes (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE decoded)</li>
              <li>✓ Selective — replicate specific tables or schemas</li>
              <li>✓ Cross-version, cross-platform</li>
              <li>✓ Used for migrations, read-scaling, event streaming</li>
              <li>✗ DDL not replicated automatically</li>
              <li>✗ Sequences not synced</li>
            </ul>
            <pre class="sql-details-pre thin-scrollbar mt-2 text-[10px]">{`-- on publisher
CREATE PUBLICATION my_pub FOR TABLE orders, users;

-- on subscriber
CREATE SUBSCRIPTION my_sub
  CONNECTION 'host=publisher ...'
  PUBLICATION my_pub;`}</pre>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </details>

    <!-- Theory: monitoring lag -->
